STATUS: BUILT
DATE: 2026-07-26
RAW_SHARE: 0.4211 (n=4182, from S5R_bhat.rds$baseline)
P_BRACKET: [0.370, 0.421]
NOTE: Shape unidentified (INV-029). Lower endpoint is the normal form at the
   cohort-hardened arm. Upper endpoint is the empirical share of
   non-positive estimates, which requires no distributional assumption.
   The normal form at the noise-only arm exceeds that share, indicating
   that normality overstates the left tail; it is reported in the
   P_normal_form column but is not used as an endpoint.
   SD values now read from T21_arms.csv (not hardcoded).
